  blocks:
  - phase: 2
    anyTimeOfDay: 0
    timeOfDay: 0
    anyDay: 1
    dayNumber: 0
    lines:
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: Uhm Hello!
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 0
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: Ah, Sami told me you would be coming in today. I am Yang, youmay
        call me Sensei.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: Sensei Yang. I would like to join this dojo. I uhm... recently suffered
        a back..
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: 'I know about your injury. Herniated discs in the lower vertibrae
        right. I had that too a few years back. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: I must say you have done well getting back on your feet. Good work
        on getting through your physio.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: Thank you Sensei. Sami told me you could help me get back to fighting
        tournaments.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: You are not ready for tournaments, so I can not allow you to join
        them,, but if you wish to train, heal and strengthen yourself, You're welcome
        to join.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: But Sensei, I want to fight
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: That will come a little later, today, show me where you are at physically,
        train with me for the day, then we can go on to sparring and beating each
        other up.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: But..
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: No more arguments. Come! Join our training. Let me see what level
        you are at!
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
